  "description": "Auretha is a modern luxury serif typeface designed to express elegance, sophistication, and timeless beauty. Featuring high-contrast strokes, refined curves, and distinctive serif details, Auretha creates a graceful yet powerful typographic presence for premium visual identities.\nWith 8 weights ranging from Thin to Extra Bold, Auretha offers versatile styling for luxury branding, fashion editorials, beauty products, packaging, magazine covers, and sophisticated advertising. Its elegant proportions and carefully crafted letterforms balance classic serif aesthetics with a contemporary editorial character.\nBring timeless elegance, refined typography, and contemporary luxury to your creative projects with Auretha Modern Luxury Serif.",
  "fullDescription": "<p>Auretha is a modern luxury serif typeface designed to express elegance, sophistication, and timeless beauty. Featuring high-contrast strokes, refined curves, and distinctive serif details, Auretha creates a graceful yet powerful typographic presence for premium visual identities.</p>\n<p>With 8 weights ranging from Thin to Extra Bold, Auretha offers versatile styling for luxury branding, fashion editorials, beauty products, packaging, magazine covers, and sophisticated advertising. Its elegant proportions and carefully crafted letterforms balance classic serif aesthetics with a contemporary editorial character.</p>\n<p>Bring timeless elegance, refined typography, and contemporary luxury to your creative projects with Auretha Modern Luxury Serif.</p>",
